Found one real problem: the summer Sunday hours appear twice in the opening-hours section. The business facts carry the note ("Julija in avgusta smo odprti tudi ob nedeljah od 9.00 do 12.00."), and the section's `note` prop repeats it. The first sentence in the screenshot is the small hours-table note and the second is bold, so the same sentence shows twice. I removed the section's `note`.

The other points are fine or intended. The label hero with address on the card is a trade-template design. The homepage has the hero address, hours and a call-out contact, but the call-out is the intended closing section and the hours section is the only hours block, so nothing repeats beyond the note. The 'Imamo tudi' text lists the remaining products from the client's text.


